{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_title", "source_sha256": "28fd8c7eaa2b3709478cb661c5eaa3cc108693aa5dcbce7c6c62430f669b1dab", "ja": "純真Days！", "zh": "纯真Days！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0b4f08580fd580de6119e873816604e982679d9c3308b9af028bd0d191159dae", "ja": "星梨花のセンターが決まり、彼女を支えよう\nと仲間たちが集結した。ファンを楽しませる\nために出てくるアイディアの中から星梨花が\n選んだ答えは『いつも通りに』。力を出し切\nった星梨花は、ステージを成功させる。", "zh": "星梨花被选为Center，于是同伴们为了\n帮助她而聚在一起。在各种能满足粉丝的提案\n之中，星梨花选出的答案是『一切照常』。\n而全力以赴的星梨花，也顺利完成了表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4da927c1500dc2529680ae9293524d0056cc9652b09b77e9b5302f01621b913d", "ja": "（次の公演に向けてのレッスンが始まったけど、\n星梨花の様子はどうだろう？）", "zh": "（下次公演的练习已经开始了，\n星梨花的状况不知道如何？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1fe5f784beaabde4d055ffc6cd5549733d51fc2e54dcbec64028230e7d7de9aa", "ja": "（お、いたいた。今日は……、麗花と紗代子も一緒か）", "zh": "（啊，找到了。今天是……和丽花还有纱代子一起吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "79c83efef3e7f9aea879c854bac0254bbb9e1827e761e96fd1cd77a6a51dc3ff", "ja": "星～梨花ちゃん♪　聞いたよ、次の公演で\nセンターを任されたんだってね！　おめでとう！", "zh": "小～星梨花♪我听说了喔，\n你是下次公演的Center对吧！恭喜你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "6ba8571371c25331240bbb60002f003986ca4fef54b12354d8d7e37847860c6b", "ja": "私、たっくさん応援しちゃうね！\nドンドンドンドン、パフー♪", "zh": "我会好好给你加油的！\n咚咚咚咚、叭噗～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "27c20243648512e51f32b4b80d4c821e2dc8c50d68ad8f899eddffc595c955cc", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん、頑張ってねっ！\n私も、麗花さんに負けないぐらい応援するよ！", "zh": "星梨花，要加油喔！\n我也不会输给丽花姊，努力替你加油打气的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "e0d713604fdd243322dc414082e341cc36ecd66175ad47afa7aa5df29b880331", "ja": "麗花さん、紗代子さん、ありがとうございます！\nおふたりに応援してもらえるなら、百人力ですね♪", "zh": "丽花姊姊、纱代子姊姊，谢谢你们！\n有你们两位的支持，让人觉得很安心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "2420caca136765d8a687fa01224b03e4ce71f07b5fc8bd99aaa2732956c2b189", "ja": "ちょっと、星梨花？\nそんなのんきに笑ってる場合じゃないと思うよ。", "zh": "等一下，星梨花。\n现在不是悠哉说笑的时候了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "2a3e7fa14e334c05954c94bbdf9458a00621514f3e6edcdc43632d7092faeaf4", "ja": "星梨花は、センターがどれだけ重要で大変なことか、\nわかってるの？", "zh": "你真的知道当Center有多重要、多不容易吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "53ea9f9f973e13a4d542659ee32b4c4d179fdac938c839b9c247010aa5f6f0f1", "ja": "えっと、それは……。", "zh": "那个，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "d554aa622b2ff6d40c982d19b378c7edb98ea9582f737df32f551f1b41e774da", "ja": "はぁ、やっぱり。そんなことだろうと思ったよ。\nわからないなら、桃子が教えてあげる。", "zh": "唉，桃子早就猜到会是这样了。\n如果你不知道，那就由桃子告诉你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "70c24f836c6f830b033773fc123531e0a0dc01818566d6975df3e07ec24a867f", "ja": "いい？　センターっていうのは、公演の主役なの。\nつまり次の公演の主役は、星梨花ってこと！", "zh": "听好啰，所谓的Center，就是公演的主角。\n也就是说，下次公演的主角是星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "c69887c9d1673dc6b87ebd9221cedb1070bf3ca8e0d8ef86516c2793dc5c86ad", "ja": "主役は、公演のメンバーやお客さんを、引っ張って\nいかなくちゃなんだよ。その覚悟、星梨花にあるの？", "zh": "身为主角，必须要引领公演的团员，\n还有现场的观众。你做好心理准备了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "dfd6097b8835a2a00ae57a1999d2b8abe936039f157cd0ccbe72f5ba08bd0452", "ja": "わたしが、みんなを……。\nう、うーん。わたしに、できるでしょうか……？", "zh": "我来引领大家……\n唔、唔……我做得到吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "f3fa00fa1fa29fc8f04d7d67950f442eae40d3ca820ca83e0fade6ab39528c5c", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、星梨花さん。", "zh": "不用担心，星梨花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1014_032emi", "source_sha256": "2d527cfad1749628808bccf61f5d111792e5fe2d14323a1fd596cf11c5e7276d", "ja": "星梨花さん主役の舞台が、素敵なものになるように。\n私も、精いっぱいお手伝いさせていただきますね。", "zh": "为了让星梨花担任主角的舞台能非常精彩。\n我也会尽力帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "a2d73694f2ce5411c1c8fb1f046385a1d9f9a1d8d0cd53f8b6a902a19c398485", "ja": "エミリーちゃん……。\nあ、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "小艾……\n谢、谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "ed7769726934969a20ee49712d2f5caeabb1cad51f78c70ab9cccddf3c29549f", "ja": "もちろん、私達もだよ！\n全力で協力するからね！", "zh": "我们当然也是喔！\n大家都会竭尽所能帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "33f154a7011e18cd57bbdfbf9ab23d9ece31169cc2e3f21410369694478ffa42", "ja": "うんうん！　星梨花ちゃん、一緒に頑張ろうね♪", "zh": "嗯嗯！小星梨花，我们一起加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "be2f97cc843817679c0e9c20834eca0db5bb723dc85bbcb6dbeed987bdadfb79", "ja": "はぁ……仕方ないから、桃子も手伝ってあげる。\nその代わり、ビシバシいくからね？", "zh": "唉……没办法，桃子也来帮忙吧。\n但桃子会很严格喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "33ed2567bb5b1c8ec78e0c6c0e5b4973bb16082c4ef37562e88151e428ea2fac", "ja": "みなさん、ありがとうございます！\nよろしくお願いしますね！", "zh": "谢谢你们！\n还请大家多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1020_p", "source_sha256": "203a82ef05421e5e9ddea6616226072f60bbecd743602bc13470151626b02fb0", "ja": "（みんなが星梨花に協力して、ひとつの公演を\n作り上げようとしてる……うん、いい空気だな）", "zh": "（大家一起帮忙星梨花，携手打造公演……\n嗯，气氛非常好呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1021_p", "source_sha256": "f7eaadd37a0557c795dca5f5c63fff229ff81ecb916251c3bc6c4f55c38b89b5", "ja": "（これも、星梨花の人柄というか……\n性格の良さのなせる業かもしれない）", "zh": "（或许这也是因为星梨花的为人……\n或是她的好人品，才能有这样的结果。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1022_032emi", "source_sha256": "41fa85711194dd99f14e0a1d632409965080a959dc179d8d669620e684d4216a", "ja": "それでは、星梨花さんの主役公演を成功させるためにも\n……どうすればいいのか、意見を出し合いませんか？", "zh": "为了让星梨花当主角的公演能成功……\n我们要不要各自提出意见，讨论该怎么做才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "c31447113d3651faf899d5d2db18648bb69075a5000ec34633c46a024e3db840", "ja": "はいは～い！\n私は、何か、特別なことをするといいと思います♪", "zh": "我先我先～！\n我觉得可以做些特别的事♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "ed57aa80fe3bf07d1a9d8204339282a53f3e741876bc5b121d9d84db78036c1c", "ja": "特別なこと、ですか？", "zh": "特别的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "11b1597ab9c9483ab231e40b80ce3e097e8079b728e78971df5bfb43ce6f3bb2", "ja": "うん！　やっぱりお客さんも、普通の公演より、\nわわっ！って驚ける方が楽しいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "嗯！比起普通的公演，\n客人应该也觉得会让人吓一跳的公演更有趣吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1026_027say", "source_sha256": "76c903af852927a58d5927dabe3361778c7e42040ee673f522df98356f8af574", "ja": "そうだね、せっかくの星梨花ちゃんのセンター公演だし\n……印象に残るものにしてあげたいですよね！", "zh": "确实如此，难得星梨花担任Center的公演……\n希望能让观众印象深刻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1027_027say", "source_sha256": "fb1dcde1bd62dba6554e9c780ecba88a95b52dd7e6d5afb1e90e06119c7bfe18", "ja": "みんなが「今日の公演、星梨花ちゃんならではだった」\nと思えるようなものだと、よりいいと思う！", "zh": "如果能让大家觉得「今天的公演\n只有星梨花才办得到」，那就更好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "edaf164fc892be2597b9636b74057317c62d44ebb17a0bb95c89eef6342d6fb8", "ja": "わたしならではの……そ、そうですよね。\nでも、どうしたら……？", "zh": "只有我才办得到……说、说得也是。\n可是，该怎么做才好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1029_049mom", "source_sha256": "f60f3f81f0c0aa605b98b2bccca9c2151fbcb89f475264fdd535c7689dbe60e9", "ja": "桃子は、真ん中に立つプレッシャーに負けないように、\nメンタルを鍛えた方がいいと思うけど……。", "zh": "桃子觉得应该要锻炼精神力，\n这样站在正中间时才不会被压力击垮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1030_049mom", "source_sha256": "eac24bf5049ddb2a5bc128b8ea935901e670a74334aefdc157b2d4c873dbe4fe", "ja": "麗花さん達の意見も一理あると思うし、賛成だよ。\n星梨花は、どんなことがしたいとかある？", "zh": "不过，丽花姊她们的意见也有道理，桃子赞成喔。\n星梨花，你有什么想做的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "4d27715f0e793fd1131787a34f74bff14ad5e503da769ab51613bf844274c237", "ja": "ほら、お兄ちゃんも！　さっきからそんなところで\n見てるだけじゃなくて、何か意見言ったら？", "zh": "快点，大哥哥也说点什么！\n不要一直站在那边看，提些意见吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1032_p", "source_sha256": "3cf52d1a82ebbf3885f649cf925c8ffc0a025d87ac0b97772e692fd35bbcd8eb", "ja": "そうだな。でも、あまりいろんな意見が\n増えても、星梨花も困るだろうし。", "zh": "好是好，可是如果有太多种建议，\n星梨花也会很困扰吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1034_049mom", "source_sha256": "847fd98a21a3ce7beeb819afe6058da2a62f1cf58d05ef45ed4a226cfdf92465", "ja": "ふーん……そういう考え方もあるんだね。\nまあ、いいや。なら、桃子の案を言うよ？", "zh": "嗯……你这么说是也没错。\n好吧，那算了。既然这样，就说说桃子的提案吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1035_049mom", "source_sha256": "706faa230387c4a979484828aff32df596a359b8955489766b4cf0ff72cf67d9", "ja": "トークの時間を使って、お芝居をするのはどう？\n演技なら、桃子も教えてあげられるし。エミリーは？", "zh": "利用和粉丝说话的时间，演个短剧怎么样？\n演技的部分，桃子可以教你。艾蜜莉你的提议呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1036_032emi", "source_sha256": "6d5ef77aba5a378a419a2c6574adc33dd424ab7e267adbe1f346880be77cde75", "ja": "私は……踊りに、趣向を凝らすのもありかと。\n大和撫子らしい舞など、素敵だと思います♪", "zh": "我……觉得可以在舞蹈方面下功夫。\n例如很有大和抚子风格的舞蹈，应该会很棒♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1037_027say", "source_sha256": "e486ab6502192def0d45ce12f8421ebdaf4e66b0ec381022465c94501c41cc52", "ja": "舞……つまり、ダンスだよね？　百合子の時と\n同じように、特訓で体力をつけるとか……？", "zh": "舞蹈……意思是要跳舞吧？\n要和百合子那时一样，进行特训加强体力吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1038_048rei", "source_sha256": "ca5321fd9d5cb167de5044ebd2d72b51b63e16e1b09987c42ac99c087a5361e6", "ja": "体力づくりなら、山登りもいいと思うな♪\n肺活量のことなら、私に任せてね♪", "zh": "如果是要加强体力，登山也不错喔♪\n说到肺活量，就交给我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "91998a72dc6a7ad89dd7f1fd76a1cd77e4ef9df04b5a62cd2c978de1e37fc50e", "ja": "麗花さん、肺活量だけじゃダメだと思うよ。\nもっと全体を見ないと……。", "zh": "丽花姊，只有肺活量是不行的。\n要更顾虑到整体……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1040_p", "source_sha256": "bdc01e74f127ce1f14dd9ecfca3a1432911227ff7a89e7c1cea4295561ae35fe", "ja": "（話し合いが白熱してるな。\n星梨花が納得のいく案が出るといいけど……）", "zh": "（讨论越来越热烈。\n希望会有星梨花可以接受的提案……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
