{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_1043_032emi", "source_sha256": "5767bc0fff14e4bd44ded4ee9369a7efb54c3ef1ca647fbbab6ca5db16bf48d8", "ja": "どうですか、星梨花さん？\n何か、参考になりそうな意見はありましたか？", "zh": "你觉得如何，星梨花？\n有什么可以参考的意见吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
