{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2003_032emi", "source_sha256": "81462b06c0479b108e7944767b3774c0684d85a97ff1b8d43592522358ebc793", "ja": "私達も、星梨花さんの考えが聞きたいです。\n話していただけませんか？", "zh": "我们也想听听星梨花的想法。\n可以请你跟我们说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
