{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2005_027say", "source_sha256": "a3f3d3e76744a970ebb1bafb2099590fc41d7cac130a8fcc7713c6099992cffa", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん、遠慮なんかしなくていいんだよ。\n私達みんな、星梨花ちゃんを応援したいんだから！", "zh": "星梨花，你不用客气。\n我们都是真心想帮忙你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2006_022ser", "source_sha256": "9e0b31c7d4a1c79f5ddb1bf0c2bb009ed567436224c1b33fa62059921047c6f1", "ja": "みなさん……ありがとうございます！", "zh": "各位……谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2007_022ser", "source_sha256": "b5d79e4adcedb3da4710ea736591dfd6cab15e818ec08f8fc295e9e362c295a2", "ja": "は、はい！　その……みなさんがわたしのために、\n色々なことを考えてくれるの、すごく嬉しいです！", "zh": "我、我知道了！那个……\n大家为我想了那么多方法，我真的很高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2008_022ser", "source_sha256": "b925ad17bb5bf859f8dd2e185e8e77f100162f7f3f7844325adb681c2507fb88", "ja": "でも……わたしは、無理に特別なことをしなくても\nいいのかもしれない、って思っちゃったんです。", "zh": "可是……我觉得不需要刻意弄得特别也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2009_032emi", "source_sha256": "8cf56a490fd2eca81f7aeae95ebec3111fff1653f3ab393b67d6ed65e9454950", "ja": "星梨花さん……。", "zh": "星梨花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2010_022ser", "source_sha256": "fb5f6f99ce8d9aa675d3b36803cdd0409b786b818ac3e2ef70e60f5ef48fea30", "ja": "こんなことを言って、ごめんなさい。\nみなさんが、せっかく考えてくれたのに……。", "zh": "抱歉说出这样的话。\n难得大家替我想了那么多方法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2011_049mom", "source_sha256": "95a879fead951c00bc3789af52be6750e1c44e9dd514e20607ad252bacc79648", "ja": "そんなこと気にしないで大丈夫だよ、星梨花。\n別に、桃子の考えが一番ってわけじゃないんだし。", "zh": "你不需要放在心上，星梨花。\n桃子想的也不见得是最好的方法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2012_022ser", "source_sha256": "744711f7d2ce9204f10e0ebf38c38f7e3f53361b810dfba6bd404b823b5617d8", "ja": "わたし、ファンのみなさんに楽しんでもらうには、\nどうしたらいいのかなって。ずっと考えてたんです。", "zh": "我一直在想，该做些什么，\n才能让粉丝们觉得开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2013_022ser", "source_sha256": "5fc6bd58d8e7c101e924baa4a505b550fea6dc4abaa939385a3b2f8bd3bfbf0f", "ja": "みなさんは、なんのために、わたし達の公演に\n来てくれるんだろうって……。", "zh": "大家又是为了什么，\n才来看我们的公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2014_p", "source_sha256": "e91ab40110d2794335acbd41bff9ca735eeb4b63f387eae600bb7abcbfdb0190", "ja": "答えは出たのか？", "zh": "有找到答案了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2015_022ser", "source_sha256": "566380a249cc56d74ae972df3a6b0e33b0f4665449bba2d8910ff896a7f5ceb5", "ja": "はい！　ファンのみなさんは、わたし達の\n歌やダンスを、楽しみに来てくれるんだと思います！", "zh": "是的！粉丝们是为了欣赏我们唱歌跳舞而来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2016_022ser", "source_sha256": "909633ebec14b6776cb1d9ab459d181ecc5310ac0ea1ffa7aa5a961925122dd1", "ja": "だからわたし、歌とダンスをいつも以上に、\n一生懸命練習したらいいんじゃないかって！", "zh": "所以如果我能比平常更拚命地练习唱歌和跳舞，\n这样就足够了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2017_027say", "source_sha256": "21f094a53b400f2041019a06355447ff3939b9c012df52bc6e00bb818ae805b1", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん……。", "zh": "星梨花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2018_022ser", "source_sha256": "12752b9035bd105df6d5eb015bc65d5cc72d886c8d78619bc81d11a306613c63", "ja": "いつもみたいに頑張って、\nいつもよりも楽しいライブができれば……。", "zh": "只要能像平常那样努力，\n打造出比以往更欢乐的演唱会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2019_022ser", "source_sha256": "1cb19d92e3e68efd36874d17bf25d1ee13522a44f09f461aae08c60767b5a551", "ja": "ファンのみなさんにも、\nたくさんたくさん、よろこんでもらえるかもって！", "zh": "粉丝们应该也会觉得非常、非常开心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2020_049mom", "source_sha256": "ddba79755d4c519a782c8a6361909c08f03dc9ac644fabd36a2c291e97368dea", "ja": "ふーん、なるほどね。\n星梨花がそうしたいなら、桃子はいいと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯──原来如此。\n如果星梨花想这么做，桃子也觉得很好喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2021_032emi", "source_sha256": "22fefe110fefc72fd924ef78f844536383083cc22efa3479fad72cbb801201f9", "ja": "はい♪　私も賛成です。\nみんなで楽しく……ふふ、星梨花さんらしいですね。", "zh": "是啊♪我也赞成。\n大家一起开开心心……呵呵，很有星梨花的风格呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2022_022ser", "source_sha256": "c597897aef5d095ad5bad9ab0733684bfaebb890d16cd893cc655268040d59fa", "ja": "あの……みなさん、怒ってないんですか？", "zh": "那个……大家没有生气吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2023_049mom", "source_sha256": "f8c44186f459828a8cdfbdea6199cc2995f7c5a5d4f9435e235f6217c64690a3", "ja": "なんで怒るの？　桃子、言ったでしょ？\nセンターは公演の主役だって。", "zh": "为什么要生气？桃子说过了吧？\nCenter就是公演的主角。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2024_049mom", "source_sha256": "7f074dbe1645b9c4959d8739ebd6c5c9d7963eaace5d5f1541b4e37020766bd8", "ja": "それに、さっきみたいに必死な星梨花なら、メンバーも\nお客さんも、みんな引っ張っていけるんじゃない？", "zh": "而且如果是像刚刚那样拚命的星梨花，\n肯定能引领团队和观众，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2025_049mom", "source_sha256": "4c54ce9d090e20a1b4a847005727a35e4a3f7f79066ca93fb68c6aa5c0a81504", "ja": "というか、桃子達のことを気にしすぎ！\n星梨花はもう少し、欲張りになった方がいいと思うよ？", "zh": "话说回来，你太顾虑桃子我们了！\n星梨花也该多想想自己想要什么比较好喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2026_032emi", "source_sha256": "d7eae46a58d56fad410049e5cbbfdb92b98677f0f4f85708e467e04b8c467bfb", "ja": "ふふっ、そうかもしれませんね！\n星梨花さん、一緒に頑張りましょう！", "zh": "呵呵，说不定真的是那样呢！\n星梨花，我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2027_048rei", "source_sha256": "091b7dacbc14323bcf0b951ecc37da697ae03a161e61d4985074c1fcdab37dfe", "ja": "それじゃあ、まずはボイストレーニングかな？\nその後は、ダンスレッスンで！", "zh": "既然这样，就先从歌唱训练开始吧？\n然后接着是舞蹈训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2028_027say", "source_sha256": "ead42e2f80e55f499cda7f2c7f0a7ed2fc3a35b42faa731919beaf0502eb7341", "ja": "そうですね！\n星梨花ちゃん、みんなで楽しいライブを作ろうね！", "zh": "是啊！\n星梨花，大家一起打造一场快乐的演唱会吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2029_022ser", "source_sha256": "689dc662b01f4b89c37eca0b482895b0597d989bb280403f788011eb9f7c7bbe", "ja": "みなさん……ありがとうございます！\nわたし、頑張りますね！", "zh": "大家……谢谢你们！\n我会努力加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2030_p", "source_sha256": "e216f0f503487b44a1cfd18c4348cde79ed279ca6f4b56470e2ae5890fbdec5f", "ja": "（みんなの意見を聞くだけでなく、自分の考えを伝え、\nみんなをひとつにさせることもセンターの務め……）", "zh": "（不只听取大家的意见，还要能说出自己的想法，\n让大家团结在一起，也是Center的工作……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2031_p", "source_sha256": "143fcb5f74f95ee19d8ef64b8182f8b0b26e9b63784d6ebffd2b7d1abe38115a", "ja": "（今ので、星梨花はセンターとしてひとつ成長した。\nきっと公演当日まで、頑張ってくれるだろう！）", "zh": "（今天的事，让星梨花在作为Center方面有所成长。\n想必到公演那天为止，她都会很努力地准备吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2032_null", "source_sha256": "4c1ee2751361d7d2b0734f89aaba5a329f4de4af4b568dce7d476b69e123581d", "ja": "そして、公演当日……", "zh": "接着，来到公演当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2034_p", "source_sha256": "08303337fdbb6ebeabcd01628e874038f1af4d98412fff827c2ef77e337e2d29", "ja": "星梨花、いよいよ始まるな。\n準備は大丈夫か？", "zh": "星梨花，差不多要开始了。\n你准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2035_022ser", "source_sha256": "09ea3f20bb5c50531f67a677775e5c120df0d42b8a0037a8509a408dc74420df", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nはい、準備はできてるんですけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n是，我准备好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2036_se", "source_sha256": "f98711cb04070079f6a75522ec1c6d8f6ae32a6d8f061af2195d5a37cfd1eaa8", "ja": "ガヤガヤ……", "zh": "（人声鼎沸）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2037_022ser", "source_sha256": "75a395ff1c489f54fa07d1879d5e360c8b655008086690fd8cab44c848b44400", "ja": "お客さんが、すごくいっぱいで……\nえへへ、ちょっとだけ緊張しちゃいました。", "zh": "来了好多好多客人……\n嘿嘿，我有一点点紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2038_p", "source_sha256": "b95da8a28517629747205ae3cb92df356915df3a8c928eb3533b4ef3499a167e", "ja": "そうだな……たとえばだけど、ステージは森で、\nお客さんは森の仲間達だと思えばいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "这样啊……不然这样好了，你把舞台想像成一座森林，\n而观众都是森林里的同伴如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2039_022ser", "source_sha256": "30c47561e3f92e4eb7f129aea6ed2062f9d5329a496cd045fbc56eacda27e3c6", "ja": "ステージが森で、お客さんが森の仲間達……ですか？\nえっと、それってつまり……？", "zh": "舞台是森林，观众是森林里的同伴……是吗？\n所以，意思是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2040_p", "source_sha256": "b73f957ece11dbb1ea3c73529e1119bef3fcdfef4333ca518d97e7472d97be9a", "ja": "つまり……\nみんな、仲間だってことだ！", "zh": "意思是……\n大家都是好伙伴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2041_022ser", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2042_049mom", "source_sha256": "7988fe6f74aa68636dc2a0ed5acc4a8a0f7dacb7033fc19a3422ef76bebe1a24", "ja": "心配しなくても大丈夫だよ。もし星梨花がミスしても、\n桃子達がちゃんとフォローするから。", "zh": "你不用担心，就算星梨花出错了，\n桃子我们也都会好好支援。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2043_032emi", "source_sha256": "219e592a2d27b90fe9dede3c5ae8690702b95442b2748ceed154ab88383634c5", "ja": "みんなで楽しく、ですよね。星梨花さん♪", "zh": "大家一起开心表演吧，星梨花♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2044_022ser", "source_sha256": "96fbd175477520e3c7d15da684dcb915e25b52ec4fbc0e989f0d2f02efacd35c", "ja": "桃子ちゃん、エミリーちゃん……。\nはい、そうですね！", "zh": "小桃、小艾……\n嗯，说得也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2045_022ser", "source_sha256": "7309fac492162a7a5eee28b20b6b707c8faae6a45f43aaea231db58a49d8e9bc", "ja": "{$P$}さん。わたし、みんなが\n楽しくなるように、一生懸命笑顔で歌ってきますね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n我会用尽全力面带笑容唱歌，让大家都能开心起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_007_2046_p", "source_sha256": "f5172d7d037dd9292312d5be26e8c82c3fe92893165ea8eb60ec973f426413e4", "ja": "ああ。行ってこい！", "zh": "嗯，去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
